        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Plant with a production of 100 m3/h. Two-bed system with a strong acidic cation resin volume of 5.3 m3 and a strong base anion resin volume of 2.8 m3. Unit is operated with counterflow regeneration, a defgasser and without lime decarbonation. Life time of the unit 15 y and of the resin 5 y. 7500 h/a operating time. Tank material stainless steel, lining PP.\n\n# Included processes\nstrong acidic cation and strong base anion resin, material used for plant, transport of materials , land use of pant, no menergy for the manufacturing included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
